  "notes": "Drawn from three dated photos of N917NN, all of the left side (2023-02-26, 2024-06-23, 2025-04-11). The tail cone under the tailplane is partly hidden in every shot. The stripes run lower forward of about x 0.33, clearing room for the American title, and step up aft of it. Colors in the 2024 shot are film-shifted; the 2025 shot set them. Belly and the right side not seen. Re-checked 2026-11-15 on the right side (N917NN, 2023): 'AirCal' on the fin is turned about 36 degrees, rising aft from the leading edge's foot (fin x 0.02, y 0.15) to mid-chord at about half height; the fuselage title runs x 0.214-0.324 measured against the doors (737-800), as drawn."
